    enTitle: "Protein synthesis — the five stages rather than four, aminoacyl-tRNA synthetases and their proofreading as the place fidelity actually comes from, the A/P/E sites, peptidyl transferase as ribozyme chemistry, the energetic cost of one peptide bond, and the antibiotic acting at each stage",
