          3: { en: "Proofreading does not track the class division. It tracks whether the amino acid has a close structural relative — Cys-tRNA synthetase, a class I enzyme, shows little or none.", cn: "**校对与两类的划分并不重合。**它跟的是**这个氨基酸有没有结构上相近的邻居**——Cys-tRNA 合成酶属于 I 类，却**几乎没有校对活性**。" }
